Baʼii barreessi: ['Test object'], dhaabi.
>> p := Daandii /tmp.
Baʼii barreessi: p, dhaabi.
>> old-p-address := p fakkeenya-jalqabaa teessoo-memoorii.
p save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
Baʼii barreessi: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], dhaabi.
>> b := Wanta load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
(b fakkeenya-jalqabaa teessoo-memoorii = old-p-address) yoodhugaa: {
	Baʼii barreessi: ['Object link re-attached.'], dhaabi.
}.
Baʼii barreessi: b, dhaabi.
